1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:03,100
Forty zombies are leaning on the
only door you have.

2
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:04,740
And the steel is starting to bend.

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,380
Seven days earlier.

4
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:07,560
It's 3:07 a.m.

5
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:11,090
You're alone on the night shift at a
highway gas station.

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,980
Then the door chime rings...

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,580
and whatever just walked in is
not here for gas.

8
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,420
You slam the lockdown button.

9
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:20,280
Steel shutters crash down.

10
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,300
Day one.

11
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,640
Twenty-nine to go.

12
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:23,567
Day seven.

13
00:00:23,587 --> 00:00:24,256
4:40 a.m.

14
00:00:24,276 --> 00:00:27,950
A car alarm starts screaming in
the parking lot.

15
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:32,240
By sunrise, there are forty of them
pressed against your shutter.

16
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,360
Forty bodies.

17
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:37,300
Six thousand pounds of weight against
one sheet of steel.

18
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,280
The shutter bends.

19
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:39,540
One bolt pops.

20
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:40,680
Then another.

21
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,720
This is where most people make
their first mistake.

22
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:44,540
They panic.

23
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:45,540
They make noise.

24
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,740
They try to run.

25
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,180
You do the opposite.

26
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:49,020
Shoes off.

27
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:49,720
Lights off.

28
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:52,080
You crawl behind the counter, and
you don't move.

29
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,740
For eleven hours.

30
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:59,050
Rule of the night shift: silence is the only
weapon that never runs out.

31
00:00:59,210 --> 00:01:01,930
By nightfall they drift away, one by one.

32
00:01:01,950 --> 00:01:05,090
And then, on the night of Day 12,
someone knocks.

33
00:01:05,130 --> 00:01:06,030
Not a scratch.

34
00:01:06,110 --> 00:01:06,750
A knock.

35
00:01:06,770 --> 00:01:07,710
Three times.

36
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:09,170
Who's knocking?

37
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:12,830
Find out in the full thirty days,
on my channel.

